Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:05.07,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS}\N{\c&Hff8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,{\fn}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.96,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.20,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.80,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Once upon a time, in a certain place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.55,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistoric creatures full of personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.95,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Tirano, Stego, Ammonite,Trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.99,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}They've been saying "hi" for 500 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.20,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistory! Everybody Say (Roar!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.68,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Ancient, Alright! Future, FLY High!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.50,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}A herd of mammoths! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.30,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Thud thud thud thud! On your marks, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.00,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Playing for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.70,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}The universe begins with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.02,opening de plannosaurus,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:04.45,Titulo do ep,,0,0,0,,{\an3\b1}Serious Iguanodon Museum{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now heading on a field trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Paleoart Museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Paleo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.87,0:01:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And the theme is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.01,0:01:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Iguanodon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF SERIOUS PALEOTOLOGY!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:22.61,Paleoart,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Paleoart,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:29.64,refers to artwork reconstructed by artists,,0,0,0,,{\i1}refers to artwork reconstructed by artists\Nbased on the image of prehistoric creatures provided\Nby researchers using fossils.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.33,0:01:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,First, take a look at this paleoart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Country of the Iguanodon"!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.81,0:01:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when the world didn't know about dinosaurs yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.69,0:01:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,in the 1830s,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.99,0:01:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,one of the world's earliest paleoarts drawn was this "Country of the Iguanodon"!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are all of these Iguanodons?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:53.50,Iguanodon,,0,0,0,,Iguanodon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:53.50,Megalosaurus,,0,0,0,,Megalosaurus
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:53.50,Crocodile,,0,0,0,,Crocodile
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on research at that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Iguanodon was thought to have a horn on the tip of its snout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:01:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks good for social media!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take a picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:04.83,Museum Manner,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Museum Matter {\i1}{\c&HFF9480&}#1!{\c&H3EEFFF&}{\c&H3EEFFF&}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.14,0:02:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not take photos of paintings without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It depends on the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, here it's allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So it IS allowed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that painting over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:21.78,Museum Manner,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Museum Manner {\b0}{\c&HFF9480&}#2!{\c&H3EEFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the designated route in the museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Going in reverse is forbidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.13,0:02:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After "The Country of the Iguanodon",
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,next is a piece of paleoart drawn about 100 years
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.49,0:02:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an Iguanodon too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,With the discovery of a complete skeleton \Nof Iguanodon in the 1870s,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,its posture changed to standing upright \Nwith its tail on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What was thought to be a horn on its nose
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it was actually found to be its thumb spike,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:03:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's beautifully corrected in this painting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyrannosaurus also had an era like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Paleoart is the culmination of passion \Nbetween researchers and artists,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,where artists artistically depict the results \Nof research at that given time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Paleo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Paleo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.89,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,after passing through all previous paleoart,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,this is modern paleoart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This artwork shows the latest Iguanodon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,modern paleoart never stops evolving!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the earliest Iguanodon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:04:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,then the tail-dragging Iguanodon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,to the latest Iguanodon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be said that CG is indeed the cutting edge of paleoart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinosaurs...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Paleo-wesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eating dinosaur chocolates \Nwhile looking at dinosaurs is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just snack time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:32.08,Museum Manner,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Museum Manner{\b0} {\c&HFF9480&}#3!{\c&H3EEFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Eating and drinking inside the museum is strictly prohibited!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the charm of paleoart \Nhasn't reached you guys at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case welcome...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,welcome to the world of serious paleoart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,To truly understand the charm of paleoart,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,becoming paleoart yourself is the best way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe! Ha ha ha!
